+       same context. SLL need to support multiple execution contexts. The execution context
+       will identify using ‘void *context’ variable.
+
+       @param context[Input]    Context Pointer of Synergy Location API.
+
+       @return
+           None.
+
+       @dependencies
+           None.
+    */
